    description = "Rechercher des documents culinaires pour des recettes, techniques et informations de planification de repas"
    inputs = {
        "query": {"type": "string", "description": "Requête culinaire en langage naturel"}
    }
    output_type = "string"
```
```python
    def __init__(self, vectorstore, k=6):
        super().__init__()
        self.vectorstore = vectorstore
        self.k = k
```
```python
    def forward(self, query):
        docs = self.vectorstore.similarity_search(query, k=self.k)
        return "\n\n".join(doc.page_content for doc in docs) or "Rien trouvé."
```

